    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Balancing Precision and Retention in Experimental Design\"\nsubtitle: \"Additional Materials\"\nformat: \n  html:\n    page-layout: article\nnavbar: false\ntoc: true\n---\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n:::\n\n\n# Block randomization\n\n## Illustration\n\n![](precision_retention/blocking.png){fig-align=\"center\"}\n\n## Estimator\n\n$$\\widehat{ATE}_{\\text{Block}} = \\sum_{b=1}^B \\frac{n_b}{N} \\widehat{ATE}_b$$\n\n## Code\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Standard design\nlm(Y ~ Z, \n   data = data)\n\n# Block randomized\nlm(Y ~ Z + block, \n   data = data)\n```\n:::\n\n\n# Current use\n\nBased on 2022-23 articles published in APSR, AJPS, JOP, PB, CPS, JEPS.\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- preamble start -->\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vincentarelbundock/tinytable@main/inst/tinytable.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n      // Create table-specific functions using external factory\n      const tableFns_7kieyr11klcgiucm6k3b = TinyTable.createTableFunctions(\"tinytable_7kieyr11klcgiucm6k3b\");\n      // tinytable span after\n      window.addEventListener('load', function () { tableFns_7kieyr11klcgiucm6k3b.spanCell(4, 1, 1, 3) })\n      window.addEventListener('load', function () {\n          var cellsToStyle = [\n            // tinytable style arrays after\n          { positions: [ { i: '6', j: 1 }, { i: '6', j: 2 }, { i: '6', j: 3 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_vgdho5yhvexm3quyhkku',}, \n          { positions: [ { i: '1', j: 1 }, { i: '2', j: 1 }, { i: '3', j: 1 }, { i: '4', j: 1 }, { i: '5', j: 1 }, { i: '1', j: 2 }, { i: '2', j: 2 }, { i: '3', j: 2 }, { i: '4', j: 2 }, { i: '5', j: 2 }, { i: '1', j: 3 }, { i: '2', j: 3 }, { i: '3', j: 3 }, { i: '4', j: 3 }, { i: '5', j: 3 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_p0z4z2k5r4bb16bd99an',}, \n          { positions: [ { i: '0', j: 1 }, { i: '0', j: 2 }, { i: '0', j: 3 } ], css_id